  "decision_basis": "The maintainer-approved internal-only U.S. acquisition cohort includes us-fda-rems. This contract narrows that authority to the four official historical REMS CSV surfaces, the current FDA REMS index and data page, all 72 current source-native detail pages, and all 829 FDA-hosted PDF documents linked by those pages on the decision date. It permits the repository's existing conditional internal source-faithful processing policy but does not approve a general licensing conclusion, public redistribution, public release, or external publication.",
